# CR 509.1c counts requirements, one for each effect: Bot1's Llanowar Elves wears two Lures and its Guerrilla Gorilla one,
# and both attack. Bot2's Ornithopter, its only creature, is able to block either: blocking the Elves obeys two requirements,
# blocking the Gorilla one, so it must block the Elves. Blocking the Gorilla is refused, as is no block at all; the Gorilla is
# unblocked and deals 2.

